    {
      "id": "tallow-reach",
      "kind": "social",
      "title": "Port of Tallow Reach",
      "prose": "Tallow Reach smells of tar and rendered fat, its stalls hung with charts nobody admits to selling. The rival crew of the Widowmark is here too, hungry for the same score. You have a night to prepare before the Hollow Passage run.",
      "readAloud": "A dockhand spits and mutters, \"Hollow Passage takes ships the way the tide takes footprints. Doesn't leave much behind to argue with.\"",
      "art": "art-the-route-that-doesnt-come-back-tallow-reach-art",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "talk-dockhands",
          "label": "Question the dockhands about the Hollow Passage",
          "visibleWhen": {
