      "kind": "conflict",
      "title": "The Chart Warehouse",
      "prose": "Bone-white sentinels stand watch over the warehouse's locked vault: constructs animated by old ledger-magic, patrolling in slow, patient circuits. You have to slip past them to reach the charts inside.",
