    {
      "id": "widowmark-parley",
      "kind": "social",
      "title": "The Widowmark's Offer",
      "prose": "Smoke from a signal-lantern reveals the Widowmark crew anchored nearby, having tracked you into the passage. Captain Renn Oskar hails you across the water, in no mood for a fight if a deal can be struck instead.",
      "readAloud": "\"We're all chasing the same drowned fortune,\" Oskar calls. \"Question is whether we split it or sink each other trying.\"",
      "art": "art-the-route-that-doesnt-come-back-widowmark-parley-art",
