    {
      "id": "aftermath",
      "kind": "decision",
      "title": "What You Carry Out",
      "prose": "The flagship's hold is a graveyard of hoarded cargo — enough to clear the Gray Wren's debt three times over. Mika, if you found her, waits pale but breathing near the ballast. The choice of what to carry out, and what to leave behind, is yours.",
      "readAloud": "The hold groans as the wreck settles further. Whatever you're taking, take it now.",
      "art": "art-the-route-that-doesnt-come-back-aftermath-art",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "clear-the-debt",
          "label": "Load the cargo and deliver it to settle the ledger",
